/F2 12.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 480 Tm
(2. The July price increase) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 464 Tm
(What changes. On July 1 most plans' price per visit goes up by 5% to 11%, depending on) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 448 Tm
(the package and the home: about 8% on average. A plan that renews later in July changes) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 432 Tm
(on its renewal date. Every customer gets written notice by June 16, as our service) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 416 Tm
(agreement requires.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 384 Tm
(Why. Our costs have risen faster than our prices:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 68 368 Tm
(- Wages: the yearly pay rises for crew members and crew leads.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 68 352 Tm
(- Supplies: cleaning products and equipment cost more than a year ago.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 68 336 Tm
(- Visits running long: from January to May, staff time on site ran 4.9% over scheduled) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 320 Tm
(time, and we pay for that time.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 288 Tm
(What we expect. Some customers will cancel. We expect no more than 20 cancellations) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 272 Tm
(beyond our usual rate over July to September. If every plan stays, the increase adds) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 256 Tm
(about $156,000 a year.) Tj
ET
